---
<section class="py-24 bg-primary-container/5 border-t border-surface-variant" id="falar-especialista">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-gutter text-center">
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-white mb-6">Pronto para centralizar sua engenharia?</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mb-10">
            Junte-se às empresas líderes que já modernizaram a gestão de suas rotinas LISP e padrões CAD. Solicite acesso antecipado hoje.
        </p>
        <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center max-w-lg mx-auto" action="#" method="POST">
            <input class="flex-1 bg-[#0D0D0D] border border-[#262626] text-white font-body-md px-4 py-3 rounded focus:outline-none focus:border-primary-container focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary-container transition-all" placeholder="Seu e-mail corporativo" required type="email" name="email"/>
            <button class="bg-primary-container text-white font-label-md text-label-md font-bold px-8 py-3 rounded hover:bg-[#e66000] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,107,0,0.2)]" type="submit">
                Solicitar Acesso
            </button>
        </form>
        <p class="mt-4 font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface-variant">Sem cartão de crédito necessário para demonstração.</p>
    </div>
</section>
